          GUID = "194DC840",
          NextDialogue = 10107809,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "That's Henrik's office. The lodgers say it's off-limits — nobody but Henrik himself can get in. The door is securely locked, and watched... Plus, Henrik himself is in there, I didn't want to be hasty.",
